resources.string:
No backups: the last build has none.

Set a repository and its password in the config, then build:
 android.backup.repository = "/storage/emulated/0/Backup";
 android.backup.passwordFile = ./backup-password;
The phone then backs up the apps and folders the config names by itself, and here any app (its APK, its data) or folder can be backed up and brought back.
